{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, גְּלָא","hw":"גְּלָא","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גְּלָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּלָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. reveal (</strong>BH <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּלָה</span> <em>uncover, reveal</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  <em>reveal</em> secrets, human agent: Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמִגְלֵא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:47\" href=\"/Daniel.2.47\">Dn 2:47</a>; of God, Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּלֵא</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:22\" href=\"/Daniel.2.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:28\" href=\"/Daniel.2.28\">28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:29\" href=\"/Daniel.2.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:47\" href=\"/Daniel.2.47\">47</a>. <strong>P<sup>e</sup>ʿîl</strong> Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גֲּלִי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:19\" href=\"/Daniel.2.19\">19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גֱּלִי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:30\" href=\"/Daniel.2.30\">30</a>, <em>revealed</em> (W<sup>CG 225</sup> Nö<sup> LCB, 1896, 703</sup>);—of secret, c. ל pers.<br><strong>Haph.</strong>  <em>take into exile</em> (BH <strong>Hiph.</strong>), Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגְלִי</span>, c. acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:10\" href=\"/Ezra.4.10\">Ezr 4:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:12\" href=\"/Ezra.5.12\">5:12</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> loc.).","next":"BDB Aramaic, גָּלוּ","prev":"BDB Aramaic, גַּלְגַּל"}